{
  "name": "Rallying Cry",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You learn how to inspire your allies to fight on past their injuries.</p><p>When you use your Second Wind feature, you can choose up to three creatures within 60 feet of you that are allied with you. Each one regains hit points equal to your fighter level plus twice your Proficiency, provided that the creature can see or hear you.</p><p>If a creature is healed for more hit points than they are missing, they regain the difference as temporary hit points.</p>",
